      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Wukong dashes to an enemy, sending out Clones that mimic the dash to up to 2 additional enemies nearby. Each enemy struck takes (80/120/160/200/240 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage. He and his Clone gain 40/45/50/55/60% Attack Speed for 5 seconds.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ko:summary",
